# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:28
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"KIO GDrive allows you to access and edit your Google Drive files using KDE "
"applications that support KIO."
msgstr ""
"KIO GDrive भवन्तं KIO समर्थयन्तः KDE अनुप्रयोगानाम् उपयोगेन स्वस्य Google "
"Drive सञ्चिकाः अभिगन्तुं सम्पादयितुं च शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:30
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can use the gdrive KIO Worker like this:"
msgstr "भवान् gdrive KIO Worker इत्यस्य उपयोगं एतादृशं कर्तुं शक्नोति:"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:31
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>gdrive://</userinput> or "
"<userinput>gdrive://<replaceable>foo@example.com</replaceable></userinput>."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>gdrive://</userinput> अथवा "
"<userinput>gdrive://<replaceable>foo@example.com</replaceable></userinput> "
"इति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:33
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first URL shows an OAuth login dialog from Google, if no Drive account "
"has been authenticated yet, or the list of your authenticated accounts "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"प्रथमः URL Google तः OAuth प्रवेशसंवादं दर्शयति, यदि अद्यापि कोऽपि Drive "
"खाता प्रमाणीकृतः नास्ति, अथवा तस्य स्थाने भवतः प्रमाणितलेखानां सूचीं "
"दर्शयति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:36
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <userinput>gdrive://</userinput> URL can also be used at any time to "
"add an additional account."
msgstr ""
"<userinput>gdrive://</userinput> URL अपि अतिरिक्तं खातं योजयितुं कदापि "
"उपयोक्तुं शक्यते ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:38
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The URL "
"<userinput>gdrive://<replaceable>foo@example.com</replaceable></userinput> "
"lists all the files and folders from the top level of the "
"<userinput>foo@example.com</userinput> Drive account."
msgstr ""
"URL "
"<userinput>gdrive://<replaceable>foo@example.com</replaceable></userinput> "
"<userinput>foo@example.com</userinput> ड्राइव् इत्यस्य उपरितनस्तरात् "
"सर्वाणि सञ्चिकाः पुटं च सूचीबद्धं करोति वृतांत्तः।"